{"id":"4023822307194279558","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Different schools of DJing for sure. Some find it fun playing familiar music and flipping it with technical skills. I feel you kind of have to do all that to keep that side of things interesting. If it’s an artist with enough of a catalogue, between different versions, covers, enough studio tracks isolated and available… that can be fun for their fans. Would still rather go to a concert. I’ve always been more into selection and connecting the dots between music.","username":"avbleek","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@avbleek/post/DfXfRG7m5aG","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:43:40Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:51.588922058Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_b6730b80a4fd1379","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4023826591113614825","query":"演唱会","source_queries":["演唱会"],"text":"有些演唱会票，你跟它较一辈子的劲儿，它也不一定肯来，倒不如给自己松松绑，让它在那待着，你该怎么活，还怎么活。也许我的票一辈子都不来，但不是非要等票来了才能呼吸。\n一开没抢到:幼稚，有啥好生气的，生气解决不了任何问题。\n二开没抢到:给你脸了!","username":"invisean2","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@invisean2/post/DfXgPcpGRXp","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:52:10Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱会"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:41.855577599Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_de8a03ef1bac0c22","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4023870130103061261","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Since losing all my hearing last summer, I’ve grieved many firsts. \n\nFirst concert not being able to hear anything.","username":"hifi_deafie","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@hifi_deafie/post/DfXqJBfGQsN","timestamp":"2026-11-05T18:18:41Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:51.588895399Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_f4858cab5d9a074b","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4023901186650512027","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"關於今天高雄永慶超派演唱會\n由於我自己互動聲音嗓門沒有控制好音量\n導致現場的觀眾們耳朵非常不舒服😞\n在此跟您們說聲抱歉🙇🏻😞\n真的很不好意思🙏😞\n真心希望大家今天有開心的看到各自喜歡的藝人演出🙇🏻\n\n也想順便跟大家分享\n今天播放的歌單為了不衝突這次演唱會的主軸\n歌曲部分我個人篩選全英文歌曲\n也關乎到現場有小朋友的情況\n節奏的部分也特別篩選不過度重拍以及強度太高的歌單\n我知道這些細節一般人不會察覺到\n但這是我對演出的態度\n以及對主辦方的尊重🙇🏻\n\n我的任務就是跟台下的你們互動🙏\n就像你們喜愛的藝人跟你們互動是一樣的邏輯\n不認識我沒有關係\n但如果因為我的音樂你們有喜歡\n這是我的榮幸❤️‍🩹\n\n最後再次跟大家的耳朵說聲抱歉🥺\n日後或許再遇到大家\n我會調整好自己的嗓門聲量🙏\n感謝公司邀請\n所有幕前幕後工作人員辛苦了🙏🤍","username":"djswallow_tw","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@djswallow_tw/post/DfXxM9Jk5qb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:20:23Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:32.970798896Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_02a7bf41079e397d","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4023902863247569231","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"《在光裡等妳》第30章｜下一站，Las Vegas \n\n——\n\n古天樂海外演唱會第一站，竟然選在農曆年初一，仲拉埋宣萱等人一齊去Las Vegas開Show！工作狂老闆到底有咩盤算？\n\n廿幾年前，一個無心的誤會；廿幾年後，再次攜手赴美。\n\n正如《世紀大騙局》唱的：「活著是愈玩愈癲愈荒謬」！\n\n下一站，Las Vegas！當年海關的一句話，會否成為下一段驚喜的伏筆？ 🤔","username":"rabbit_831031","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@rabbit_831031/post/DfXxlWmjHFP","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:23:43Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:32.970865221Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T01:31:57.701565Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_94c1950c32b16b60","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
